    "payload_size_bytes": 4096,
    "note": "The history 2.32.0 and earlier record for the same refused all(): the members before the oversized one are recorded ActivityScheduled, then ActivityCancelled when the run fails with the payload_size refusal. Recorded history is never rewritten. The embedded replayer (WorkflowReplayer, QueryStateReplayer) replays it to the all() as before #1232. The cold fiber runner rejects it as a partial group, as it did before #1232: only part of the authored leaf set is recorded. A new run of the same workflow writes only the refusal (all-oversized-member-refused-before-first-write)."
